From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:51:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep bionic pthread cleanup handlers on arm guests

__pthread_cleanup_push and __pthread_cleanup_pop only link a guest
__pthread_cleanup_t into the calling thread's pthread_internal_t
cleanup_stack. Where the emulator gives each guest thread a bionic
thread record of the guest's own layout, bionic's definitions work
as they are; the stubs would need a host side that reads a 12-byte
arm record by the guest layout. Drop the two stubs from the arm list
so bionic's (weak for native bridge) definitions define them.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [NBS forwards to a host bionic whose thread record is the guest's]
Patch-Reason: the stub list is compiled into the guest libc; nothing outside the source removes a stub definition
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 android_api/libc/stubs_arm.cpp | 4 ----
 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android_api/libc/stubs_arm.cpp b/android_api/libc/stubs_arm.cpp
index ae669df23ee161966dcc63034df87b736e2d5dfb..74f510152ac3fbf64b28bb852b2975e186b63510 100644
--- a/android_api/libc/stubs_arm.cpp
+++ b/android_api/libc/stubs_arm.cpp
@@ -19,8 +19,6 @@
 
 DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(__clone_for_fork);
 DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(__get_thread_stack_top);
-DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(__pthread_cleanup_pop);
-DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(__pthread_cleanup_push);
 DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(android_crash_detail_register);
 DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(android_crash_detail_replace_data);
 DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION(android_crash_detail_replace_name);
@@ -62,8 +60,6 @@ DEFINE_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_VARIABLE(environ);
 static void __attribute__((constructor(0))) init_stub_library() {
   INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", __clone_for_fork);
   INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", __get_thread_stack_top);
-  INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", __pthread_cleanup_pop);
-  INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", __pthread_cleanup_push);
   INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", android_crash_detail_register);
   INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", android_crash_detail_replace_data);
   INIT_INTERCEPTABLE_STUB_FUNCTION("libc.so", android_crash_detail_replace_name);
